yee of $2.8M ranks in the above the sector median among Energy peers, with revenue growing 130%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $55K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (1/10).","financial_summary":["Ring Energy, Inc. is a small-cap energy business with a $313M market cap on $307M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -4% over the past three years and +26% annually across the full decade, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 20% against a 9% cost of capital \u2014 a 11-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin -0.8\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 8.7% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.5) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins 27% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Energy peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"ESG-driven capital flight and stranded asset risk \u2014 tightening climate policy and investor mandates raise the cost of capital and risk leaving reserves permanently in the ground.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 20% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Energy sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter","Energy ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Rethink Retail Brings Together Supply Chain Executives from Converse, David Yurman, REI and More to Launch Cross-Industry Leadership Community","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/rethink-retail-brings-together-supply-chain-executives-from-converse-david-yurman-rei-and-more-to-launch-cross-industry-leadership-community-302933450.html","date":"2026-11-09","timestamp":1794236400.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"Ring Energy Inc (REI) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Resilient Volumes and Improving ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/ring-energy-inc-rei-q3-111242577.html","date":"2026-11-07","timestamp":1794049962.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.752,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Ring Energy (REI) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/energy/articles/ring-energy-rei-q3-2026-191958565.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793992798.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.202,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Ring Energy outlines 2027 output of 21,000-23,000 boe/d with $135M-$165M capital plan as l